      "bookmarkId": "30605535_16_444-464",
      "chapterUid": 16,
      "range": "444-464",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人生最重要的事情就是如何清楚地认识自己。",
      "totalCount": 1515
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 395733554,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_8_1162-1254",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "1162-1254",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们总说要勇于做自己，但人生在世，最难的事恰恰就是做自己。因为在别人眼里我们不是“人”，而是他们所认可的“人物设定”，简称“人设”。而这个人设，其实就是人们对我们贴上的“标签”的集合。",
      "totalCount": 1309
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 17544164,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_5_773-845",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "773-845",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "认知是什么？认知是我们在接收外界输入的信息，经过头脑的加工处理，转化为内在心理活动，进而支配我们的行为，所以一个人的认知层次决定了他的发展高度。",
      "totalCount": 1232
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 283579978,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_8_7644-7676",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "7644-7676",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们的人生是漫长的，但请记住，别人评估你的时间最多只会有30秒。",
      "totalCount": 1036
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 52853406,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_9_8683-8750",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "8683-8750",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果我们真的是金子，就应该主动抓住一切机会为自己赢得大家的认可，自己发光发热，而不是一边大喊“怀才不遇”，一边只是坐等机会自己来敲门。",
      "totalCount": 816
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 22473883,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_6_603-624",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "603-624",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你的认知边界将决定你到底会拥有怎样的人生。",
      "totalCount": 784
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 15851089,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_10_1631-1650",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "1631-1650",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "别人对你的评价= 事实-人们对你的期望",
      "totalCount": 765
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 286103865,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_8_360-373",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "360-373",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "别人眼中的你不是人而是人设",
      "totalCount": 742
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 48753338,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_13_3719-3773",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "3719-3773",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "造成我们和优秀人士之间的“职场能力”巨大鸿沟的决定性因素其实是“知识能力”积累到一定程度带来的自身增值速度。",
      "totalCount": 720
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 337904073,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_8_2073-2135",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "2073-2135",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "沉锚效应是指人们在对未知的人和事物做出判断时，极易受第一印象或第一信息支配，它们就像沉入海底的锚一样把人们的思想固定在某处。",
      "totalCount": 650
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 18718159,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_4_947-979",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "947-979",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们终其一生，都在做两件事：学会和自己相处，学会和这个世界相处。",
      "totalCount": 630
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 20403150,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_18_7141-7184",
      "chapterUid": 18,
      "range": "7141-7184",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "讲故事的更高境界，是重塑听众对一个事物的认知。它是什么不重要，人们认为它是什么才重要。",
      "totalCount": 624
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 323119716,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_13_2576-2610",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "2576-2610",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "学习与认知的本质是什么？就是将未知的信息与大脑内已知的事物进行连接。",
      "totalCount": 544
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 271269232,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_8_5334-5374",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "5334-5374",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "品牌的价值从来都不是它的名字本身，而是它长期在对消费者某个认知领域占有一定地位。",
      "totalCount": 527
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 241186916,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_13_503-598",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "503-598",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "正如当很多人无法赢得谈判，无法进行高效沟通时，从来不会意识到自己的失败是因为没有能力进行谈判策略的制定，没有意识去收集关键信息，甚至不具备问题解决者的思维模式，他们只会认为自己只是嘴笨而已。",
      "totalCount": 493
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 5426011,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_11_3411-3423",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "3411-3423",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "学会承认别人的人设和价值",
      "totalCount": 476
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 5426011,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_14_11510-11540",
      "chapterUid": 14,
      "range": "11510-11540",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "发现一个现象，揭示背后的问题，解决这个问题，这才是一个闭环。",
      "totalCount": 473
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 283579978,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_9_2121-2138",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2121-2138",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "好印象=好的第一印象＋持续增加曝光",
      "totalCount": 468
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 38616207,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_25_3571-3592",
      "chapterUid": 25,
      "range": "3571-3592",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "聚焦从来都是目的的聚焦，而不是方式的聚焦。",
      "totalCount": 468
    },
    {
      "bookId": "30605535",
      "userVid": 48753338,
      "bookmarkId": "30605535_20_5416-5469",
      "chapterUid": 20,
      "range": "5416-5469",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "沟通的最高境界是通过交流厘清对方真正的底层需求，最后用自己开放性的思维提出共赢的解决方案并与对方达成共识。",
      "totalCount": 432
    }
